\section*{Problem 4 (30 marks)}
Peter (P1): Type $H$ w.p.\ $0.2$, type $L$ w.p.\ $0.8$. Cost of $N$ papers: $2N$ (H), $3N$ (L). If Uni accepts: Peter gets $5$, Uni gets $+1$ (H) or $-1$ (L). If Uni rejects: all get $0$.
Peter's net acceptance payoff: $5-2N$ (Type H), $5-3N$ (Type L).

